Python-based client for downloading data files hosted by the an instance of the
portal software from the Institute for Genome Sciences (IGS).  There are
several portals running on the internet to support various research efforts.
The client accepts a *manifest file* as an input. This file contains URLs to
the files to be downloaded. Manifest files can be generated using the shopping
cart functionality of the portal's query interface. The client supports GCP
(Google Cloud Platform) storage, HTTP, FTP, Amazon AWS S3, and Aspera (FASP).
